<section id="subjects">
  <h2>Subjects covered</h2>
  <p class="section-lede">Full Ontario mathematics curriculum, grade 8 through 12, plus first- and second-year college math. If a topic isn't listed, ask — most gaps trace back to one or two earlier ideas, and we can work backward to find them.</p>

  <div class="subject-group">
