    <p class="group-note">Ontario elementary math strands — the foundation everything after builds on.</p>
    <ul class="subject-list">
      <li>Number sense &amp; operations <span class="level">Strand</span></li>
      <li>Algebra &amp; patterning <span class="level">Strand</span></li>
      <li>Data &amp; probability <span class="level">Strand</span></li>
      <li>Spatial sense &amp; geometry <span class="level">Strand</span></li>
      <li>Financial literacy <span class="level">Strand</span></li>
    </ul>
